  "primary_source_relationships": [
    "Parent ON_START only creates derived child when child not already present; finishDerivedBuffIfParentFinishFalse keeps child through parent expiry. This does not prove no damage-rate reset.",
    "Child ON_START is BleedingDamageIncreasingReset; trigger1s/infinite lifetime, PURE BUFF ignoreSPtrue and skipModifierfalse. Exact first tick arithmetic/body is not recovered.",
    "Bena switchbegin/switchend ClearAllBuffs retain only named Bena keys and alsoRemoveDurableFalse. Both dragon_fire and derived child are isDurableFalse, so their infinity lifetime is not immunity to clear. New child after such clearing necessarily re-enters ON_START reset.",
    "Bena_s_2 uses DamageViaMaxHpRatio with skipModifiertrue, separate from dragon_fire skipModifierfalse; do not infer identical modifier bypass or source attribution."
  ],
